# The wanderers, the hub (docs/DIALOGUE.md, "Hubs: work comes out of talk"): each role's "Need a
# hand?" (slot 2, the wanderers' asks) comes out of their own trouble, told their way. Not while
# they're bitten (slot 2 is the antidote then). The road's news is theirs too, and not all of it is
# true. Voice: plain, each person their own.

conv wanderer.trader.trouble
for wanderer:trader
when !wbitten
topic "Ask how trade's been."
prio ask
voice plain

node start
  say? outbreak:overrun :: "Slow. Nobody walks to market when the market might eat them."
  say? need:food :: "Everybody wants food and nobody's got anything to swap for it but stories. I don't eat stories."
  say? rain :: "Wet. Wet stock is cheap stock. I'm selling damp bandages at a very fair price."
  say "Up and down. Mostly down. I'm an optimist about the up."
  > @why "What's the hold-up?" -> hold
  > @cut "And if I helped? What's my cut?" -> cut
  > @hand "Need a hand?" -> hub   do call:slot:2
  > @no "Good luck with it." -> hub

node hold
  say "Roads. Tolls. People. Mostly people. Somebody always wants the thing you're carrying more than you do."
  > @hand1 "Need a hand, then?" -> hub   do call:slot:2
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

node cut
  say "Your cut is my gratitude and a better price next time. My gratitude is very sincere. My prices are less so."
  > @hand2 "Fair. Need a hand?" -> hub   do call:slot:2
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

conv wanderer.doctor.trouble
for wanderer:doctor
when !wbitten
topic "Ask who they're worried about."
prio ask
voice plain

node start
  say? dusk :: "Whoever's still out after dark. It's nearly dark. So, everyone."
  say? outbreak:collapse :: "Everybody with a scratch who's telling themselves it's a fence."
  say? symptoms :: "You, mostly. Sit down. No, really. Sit."
  say "The ones who won't come to me. They're always the ones who should."
  > @who "Anyone in particular?" -> who
  > @nurse "Let me sort your bag for you." -> kit   if bg:nurse,doctor
  > @hand "Need a hand?" -> hub   do call:slot:2
  > @no "Take care of yourself." -> hub

node who
  say "A family on the farm road with a child who coughs. A man who won't let anyone see his leg. Ordinary things."
  say "Ordinary things kill more people than the dead do. They're just slower about it."
  > @hand1 "Need a hand with them?" -> hub   do call:slot:2
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

node kit
  say "You know what you're looking at. Good. Half of this is expired. The other half I'm pretending isn't."
  > @hand2 "Then need a hand?" -> hub   do call:slot:2
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

conv wanderer.scavenger.trouble
for wanderer:scavenger
when !wbitten
topic "Ask what they're after."
prio ask
voice plain

node start
  say? town:looted :: "Anything nobody's taken. Round here that's a short list. This town's been picked to the bone."
  say? night :: "Sleep. But since you're asking, batteries."
  say "Whatever's left. Whatever's worth a tin. Same thing, these days."
  > @where "Where's worth looking?" -> where
  > @hand "Need a hand?" -> hub   do call:slot:2
  > @no "Happy hunting." -> hub

node where
  say "If I told you, it'd be worth less. Help me with something and I'll think about telling you."
  > @hand1 "Need a hand, then?" -> hub   do call:slot:2
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv wanderer.deserter.trouble
for wanderer:deserter
when !wbitten
topic "Ask if they're being followed."
prio ask
voice plain

node start
  say? kit:other :: "Maybe. You're wearing colours. Whose? Never mind. Don't stand so close."
  say? feud:bastion :: "By Bastion? They've got enough to do. They'd still make time for me."
  say "Always. Or I think so, which is the same for sleeping."
  > @why "Who'd follow you?" -> who
  > @soldier "You left your post. That counts." -> post   if bg:soldier,police
  > @hand "Need a hand?" -> hub   do call:slot:2
  > @no "Keep moving." -> hub

node who
  say "People I used to stand next to. They'd say they're looking for me. They'd mean it kindly. That's worse."
  > @hand1 "Need a hand with anything?" -> hub   do call:slot:2
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

node post
  say "It isn't. I know. I still hear the roll some nights. My name's on the board as missing. That's the kind word."
  > @hand2 "Need a hand anyway?" -> hub   do call:slot:2
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

conv wanderer.preacher.trouble
for wanderer:preacher
when !wbitten
topic "Ask what they're praying for."
prio ask
voice plain

node start
  say? epilogue :: "That the road out is a road out. I've stopped praying for big things. I'm saving my breath."
  say? cure>=75 :: "For the lab. Don't tell anyone. I'd lose my reputation for not trusting anything."
  say? outbreak:overrun :: "For quiet. The bells were for company. They brought the wrong company."
  say "For whoever needs it. You can have one if you like. Free. It's the only free thing left."
  > @bells "Why the bells?" -> bells
  > @hand "Need a hand?" -> hub   do call:slot:2
  > @no "Pray for me, then." -> hub

node bells
  say "So the lonely ones know someone's here. The dead hear it too. Everything has a cost now. Even comfort."
  > @hand1 "Need a hand with anything?" -> hub   do call:slot:2
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv wanderer.courier.trouble
for wanderer:courier
when !wbitten
topic "Ask whose letters are late."
prio ask
voice plain

node start
  say? outbreak:overrun :: "Everyone's. The roads are theirs now. I go round. Round takes days."
  say? edge :: "There's a letter for someone outside the line. I carry it anyway. One day there'll be an outside again."
  say "A mother in one town for a son in another. Neither knows the other's alive. I'm the only one who knows both."
  > @why "Why not deliver them?" -> why
  > @hand "Need a hand?" -> hub   do call:slot:2
  > @no "Safe roads." -> hub

node why
  say "Because one of the towns is a bad town now. I'd go. I'm a coward, not an idiot. Mostly a coward."
  > @hand1 "Need a hand with it?" -> hub   do call:slot:2
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

# The road's news. A wanderer's version of a burned town has the Red Hand in it, which the Red Hand
# denies with the truth (~truth:gossip.burned@burned, their leaders and people).
conv wanderer.road.news
for wanderer:trader, wanderer:scavenger, wanderer:deserter, wanderer:preacher, wanderer:courier, wanderer:doctor
topic "Ask what they passed on the road."
prio world
voice plain

bind burned = news:burned
bind took = news:taken
bind who = news:taken_by
bind from = news:taken_from
bind dead = news:leader_dead
bind at = news:leader_dead_at
bind horde = news:horde
bind truck = news:truck
bind bit = news:bite

node start
  jump news:burned -> burned
  jump news:leader_dead -> dead
  jump news:taken -> taken
  jump news:horde -> horde
  jump news:truck -> truck
  jump news:bite -> bite
  say? epilogue :: "Queues at the road checkpoints. People in their good coats. Processing, they call it."
  say? edge :: "Drones. Close to the line, there's always one. It hums like it's thinking about you."
  say? stage:fever :: "You, looking like that. Sit down a minute before you fall down."
  say "Nothing. Empty cars. A shoe in the road. There's always a shoe in the road."
  > @back0 "Something else." -> hub

node burned
  say "{bind:burned}, burning. The Red Hand's work. I saw their truck on the road after." ~lie:gossip.burned@burned
  > @catch "The Red Hand say burning is waste." -> caught   callout gossip.burned@burned
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

node caught
  say "Do they. Well. It was a truck. On a road. I might have filled in the rest. People like a story with someone in it."
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

node dead
  say "{bind:dead} is dead. In {bind:at}. I heard it three ways. Two of them were sad about it."
  > @back3 "Something else." -> hub

node taken
  say "{bind:who} put their flag up at {bind:took}. {bind:from} took theirs down. Nobody's flag stopped the dead."
  > @back4 "Something else." -> hub

node horde
  say "A crowd near {bind:horde}, following some noise. I went round. Round is my favourite direction."
  > @back5 "Something else." -> hub

node truck
  say "A truck that didn't get there. {bind:truck}. Doors open, nobody in it. I didn't look in the back."
  > @back6 "Something else." -> hub

node bite
  say "Somebody got bitten near {bind:bit}. Saw the blood on the road. Saw the person walk on. Brave, or not thinking yet."
  > @back7 "Something else." -> hub
